  "content": "<p>就是这样，这就是它的全部功能。该资源包为原版Minecraft字体添加了略微改进的版本——在32x分辨率下重新绘制了原始字体。下方展示了它的实际效果！</p><p>它以MIT许可证发布，您可以自由地在整合包和视频/直播中使用。</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4y11sHi.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>建议您在原版游戏/资源包之上启用此资源包。</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fnYLbLk.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>现在也支持Unicode字符了！</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3udcSxQ.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flinks.latvian.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://links.latvian.dev/links.png?cf=slightlyimprovedfont\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flinks.latvian.dev%252fpartner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://links.latvian.dev/partner.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
